          <h2>USTA Regulation Specifications</h2>
          <p>Every tennis court we construct meets United States Tennis Association standards for dimensions, surface characteristics, and safety requirements.</p>
          
          <h3>Official Court Dimensions</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Playing area: 78 feet × 36 feet</li>
            <li>Total recommended space: 120 feet × 60 feet</li>
            <li>Net height: 3 feet 6 inches at posts, 3 feet at center</li>
            <li>Service boxes: 21 feet × 13.5 feet each</li>
            <li>Baseline to service line: 18 feet</li>
            <li>Singles court width: 27 feet (4.5-foot alleys on each side)</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Surface Standards</h3>
